;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="230" width="360" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="객체명 해시로 대상 선택&lt;br&gt;16회 스캔에 걸쳐 전체 객체 1회 확인" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="310" width="360" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="작업 시간 × 속도 계수(기본 10.0) 대기&lt;br&gt;읽기/쓰기 요청에 I/O 양보(일시 정지)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="390" width="360" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a4" value="느려지는 요인&lt;br&gt;드라이브 종류 · 네트워크 처리량&lt;br&gt;객체 수·크기 · 기타 부하" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="480" width="360" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b0" value="① 데이터 사용량 계산" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="150" width="320" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b1" value="② ILM · 보존 규칙 평가/적용&lt;br&gt;(Transition · Expiration)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="260" width="320" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b2" value="③ Bucket/Site Replication&lt;br&gt;PENDING · FAILED 객체 재큐잉" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="370" width="320" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="④ 누락·손상 데이터 Healing" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="480" width="320" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c0" value="사용량·쿼터 수치 지연 (마지막 완료 스캔 기준)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="165" width="540" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="Transition 지연 → Hot 용량 압박 · 계획보다 늦은 이동" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="255" width="540" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="Expiration · noncurrent 정리 지연 → 버전 누적" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="305" width="540" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="3회 재시도 후 큐에서 빠진 FAILED 객체의 재큐잉 지연&lt;br&gt;→ Warm replica 누락 지속 (C1 장기화)&lt;br&gt;→ 백업 시점 품질 저하 · 복구 시 불완전 스냅샷" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="370" width="540" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="누락·손상 객체 복구(Healing) 지연" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F0;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=0;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="495" width="540" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m" value="대응  ·  mc admin scanner info · minio_scanner_* 지표 모니터링   ·   mc replicate status / resync-backlog 로 FAILED·PENDING 수동 재큐잉&lt;br&gt;·  noncurrent 만료 규칙으로 버전 수 억제 (excess versions 경보)   ·   scanner speed 조정은 읽기/쓰기 I/O 와 트레이드오프   ·   ILM·복제 완료 시점에 SLA 를 의존하지 말 것" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F5F7;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="680" width="1420" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="Scanner 가 느려지면 — ILM Transition · Replication 재처리 · 버전 정리가 함께 지연" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=22;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="1420" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Scanner 는 사용량 계산 · ILM/보존 규칙 · Replication 재큐잉 · Healing 을 한 사이클에서 처리 — 느려지면 네 작업이 모두 밀린다" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5E6C84;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="48" width="1420" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="매 사이클" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="429" y="330" width="60" height="19" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="악순환: 버전·객체 수 증가 → 스캔 더 느려짐" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#DD344C;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="640" width="300" height="19" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
